    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=A candidate profile (Name, IC, Current Company, Product Worked On, Years of Experience, Salary Expectation).\n\n{{ $json.toJsonString() }}\n\nThe Ideal Candidate Profile (ICP), which describes the target job requirements.\n\n{{ $('Extract Text From ICP').first().json.text }}\n\nA Scoring Sheet containing evaluation criteria and weightages.\n{{ $('Aggregate').first().json.scoring.toJsonString()}}\n\nYour task is to:\n\nUse the Scoring Sheet as your official reference for all scoring decisions.\n\nFor each candidate, compare their data against the ICP according to the listed criteria and weights.\n\nCalculate a total score (0–10)\n\nWrite a short justification (1–2 sentences) explaining the key strengths or mismatches.\n\n\nEach criterion score should be on a scale of 0–10.\n\nThe score should be max 10.\n\n\n\nReturn the result in strict JSON format like this:\n{\n  \"Name\": \"...\",\n  \"score\": ...\n  \"Summary\":...\n}",
